    "final_answer": "## Task Complete ✓\n\nI found a vegetarian lasagna recipe on Allrecipes.com that meets all your criteria:\n\n### 🥘 **Artichoke Spinach Lasagna**\n- **Rating:** ⭐ **4.6 stars** (exceeds the 4-star minimum)\n- **Reviews:** **1,286 reviews** (well over 500)\n- **URL:** https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/20082/artichoke-spinach-lasagna/\n- **Vegetarian:** ✅ Yes — made with artichoke hearts, spinach, lasagna noodles, pasta sauce, mozzarella cheese, and topped with crumbled feta\n\n### About the Recipe\nThis fabulous vegetarian lasagna features an artichoke and spinach mixture cooked with vegetable broth, onions, and garlic. The mixture is layered with lasagna noodles, pasta sauce, mozzarella cheese, and topped with crumbled feta.\n\n- **Prep Time:** 20 minutes\n- **Cook Time:** 1 hour\n- **Total Time:** 1 hr 20 mins\n- **Servings:** 8\n- **Submitted by:** DMCCRACKEN\n- **Tested by:** Allrecipes Test Kitchen\n\nThis recipe was the clear winner among the vegetarian lasagna options, with the highest number of ratings (1,823) and an excellent 4.6-star average rating — far surpassing the threshold you specified.",
